---
import MathLayout from '../../../layouts/MathLayout.astro';
import { getPath } from '../../../utils/path';

const lang = 'en';
const currentPath = '/en/university/analysis';
const title = 'Mathematical Analysis';
---

<MathLayout {title} {lang} {currentPath}>
	<article>
		<h1>{title}</h1>
		<p class="intro">Analysis studies the mathematics of continuous quantities. Humanity discovered a crack in numbers themselves - some lengths cannot be expressed by rational numbers, and this is where real numbers were born.</p>

		<h2>Real Number Axioms: Accepting the "Night of Continuity"</h2>
		<div class="concept-card card">
			<p>Completeness axiom: Every non-empty set bounded above has a least upper bound. This is not construction, but acceptance - declaring that the real line has no gaps.</p>
		</div>

		<h2>Five Equivalent Propositions</h2>
		<div class="five-equivalents">
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>1. Supremum Principle</h3>
				<p>Non-empty sets bounded above have supremum</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>2. Monotone Convergence</h3>
				<p>Monotone bounded sequences converge</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>3. Nested Intervals</h3>
				<p>Nested intervals with length → 0 intersect at one point</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>4. Bolzano-Weierstrass</h3>
				<p>Every bounded sequence has a convergent subsequence</p>
			</div>
			<div class="equiv-item">
				<h3>5. Cauchy Criterion</h3>
				<p>Terms getting closer to each other must converge</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<h2>Important Theorems</h2>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Intermediate Value Theorem</h3>
			<p>Continuous function on closed interval takes every value between endpoints.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Extreme Value Theorem</h3>
			<p>Continuous function on closed interval attains maximum and minimum.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="theorem-card card">
			<h3>Fundamental Theorem of Calculus</h3>
			<p>Differentiation and integration are inverse operations.</p>
		</div>

		<h2>Learning Path</h2>
		<div class="learning-path">
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">1</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Real Number Completeness</h3>
					<p>Supremum principle, five equivalent propositions</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">2</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Sequences</h3>
					<p>Convergence, divergence, limsup, liminf</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">3</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Continuous Functions</h3>
					<p>ε-δ definition, IVT, EVT</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">4</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Differentiation</h3>
					<p>Derivative, mean value theorem, Taylor expansion</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="path-step">
				<span class="step-num">5</span>
				<div class="step-content">
					<h3>Integration</h3>
					<p>Riemann integral, FTC</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="nav-footer">
			<a href={getPath('/en/university')} class="back-link">← Back to University Math</a>
		</div>
	</article>
</MathLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.concept-card p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.five-equivalents {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.equiv-item {
		padding: 1rem;
		background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
		border-left: 3px solid #6366f1;
	}

	.equiv-item h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.equiv-item p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.theorem-card {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.1);
		border-color: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.3);
	}

	.theorem-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.theorem-card p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.learning-path {
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.path-step {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		padding: 1rem 0;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.step-num {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 2rem;
		height: 2rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316, #f43f5e);
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.step-content h3 {
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
	}

	.step-content p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.nav-footer {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		padding-top: 2rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: #f97316;
	}
</style>
